<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102103" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωφρον-έω</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σᾰοφ-</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Opp.
			<u>H.</u>
			3.446
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			5.301.11
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Agath.
		</span></i>):— <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be
				sound of mind</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				5.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.449
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃς ἦν φορητὸς οὐδὲ σωφρονῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					90.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be temperate, moderate, show self-control</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heraclit.
				112
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				116
			</span></i> (v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				982
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pers.</u>
				829
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.22.69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				2.2.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				244a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.1.30
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σωφρονεῖν,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωφροσύνη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1425
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				181
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1061
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1071
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς Ἀφροδίτην ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				1159
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ba.</u>
				314
			</span></i> (s. v.l.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τοὺς θεούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.1.20
				</span></i>
			; of soldiers, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. καὶ
			εὐτακτεῖν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.5.21
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				12.47
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. καὶ ὁμονοεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					1.109
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερφρονέω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				12.3
			</span></i>: with a part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέμποντες σωφρονοῖμεν ἄν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Men.</u>
					90d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>come to one's senses, learn moderation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.64
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ὑπὸ στένει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					521
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωφρονοῦντες ἐν
			χρόνῳ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1000
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ σωφρονήσεις</span>;
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1259
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσωφρόνησας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1259
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεσωφρονηκώς</span>
			<i>when he had recovered his senses</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				241b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ σεσωφρονημένα ἐν τῷ βίῳ
				μοι</span>
			<i>things I had done with discretion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.4
			</span></i>.</div>
